<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>管理员登录 · CSUCampusCraft</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="admin" data-authenticated="false">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-brand" href="/" aria-label="CSUCampusCraft 首页">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">CSU</span>
            <span>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span class="app-label">管理端</span>
            

            <a href="/login">登录</a>
            
            
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="container global-alerts" aria-label="全局提示区">
    
    
    

</div>
<main id="main-content" class="container main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="auth-panel" data-page-id="A01">
    <header class="page-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">CSUCampusCraft 管理端</p>
        <h1>管理员登录</h1>
        <p class="muted">请使用已启用的管理员账号登录。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="panel">
        
        <section class="alert alert-danger error-summary" role="alert" aria-labelledby="error-summary-title" tabindex="-1">
    <h2 id="error-summary-title">请修正以下输入</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <a href="#username">请检查文字是否填写及其长度。</a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>
        <form method="post" action="/login" data-submit-state>
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="[REDACTED]">
            <input type="hidden" name="returnUrl" value="/">
            <div class="form-field">
    <label for="username">用户名</label>
    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" value="aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
           aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="username-error" class="input-error">
    <p class="field-error" id="username-error">请检查文字是否填写及其长度。</p>
</div>
            <div class="form-field">
    <label for="password">密码</label>
    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password"
           aria-invalid="false">
    
</div>
            <button type="submit">登录管理端</button>
        </form>
    </div>
    <p class="field-help">会话过期或退出后，请重新登录。用户端与管理端的登录状态相互独立。</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <span>CSUCampusCraft 校园文创商城</span>
        <span class="muted">课程实验 · 教学模拟</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
